e cleanest medical establishment I\'ve ever been in.\" testimonials_author0=\"— John Marco\" testimonials_title1=\"Prior to my stay at Medicenter, I was aware of their stellar reputation and multiple friends commented about how lucky I was to have my surgery scheduled there. As a result my expectations were high and yet the kind and professional staff surpassed them.\" testimonials_author1=\"— Marliu Henner\" testimonials_title2=\"I was very pleased with my stay at Medicenter. The care that I was given by the nursing staff was as if I was one of their family members.\" testimonials_author2=\"— Adam Lambda\" testimonials_title3=\"The mind has great influence over the body, and maladies often have their origin there.\" testimonials_author3=\"— John Doe Molicere\" icon=\"1\" autoplay=\"0\" scroll=\"1\" duration=\"500\"][/vc_column][/vc_row]\n','About','','publish','closed','closed','','about','','','2018-10-25 12:36:29','2018-10-25 12:36:29','',0,'http://quanticalabs.com/wptest/medicenter-new/?page_id=3811',0,'page','',0),(3817,1,'2018-10-25 12:40:12','2018-10-25 12:40:12','[vc_row type=\"full-width\" el_position=\"first\"][vc_column][medicenter_map height=\"460px\" zoom=\"12\" icon_width=\"38\" icon_height=\"48\" icon_anchor_x=\"18\" icon_anchor_y=\"48\" icon_url=\"http://quanticalabs.com/wp_themes/wp-content/themes/medicenter/images/map_pointer.png\" el_position=\"first last\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row top_margin=\"page-margin-top-section\"][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][box_header title=\"Medicenter\" type=\"h2\" bottom_border=\"0\" class=\"large\"][vc_column_text el_class=\"large margin-top-10\"]2702 Memory Lane, Chicago, IL 60605[/vc_column_text][/vc_column][vc_column width=\"1/3\"][features ids=\"3824\" type=\"small\" headers=\"1\" headers_links=\"0\" headers_size=\"large\" read_more=\"0\" icon_links=\"0\" animation=\"scale\"][features ids=\"2962\" type=\"small\" order=\"DESC\" headers=\"1\" headers_links=\"0\" headers_size=\"large\" read_more=\"0\" icon_links=\"0\